            {
                "entry_id": "75cee9cc-7cec-3855-9ee0-c0d48c0e00c0",
                "word": "canning",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c22d0f1c-1814-464f-a392-c3029a2cbd97",
                        "entry_id": "75cee9cc-7cec-3855-9ee0-c0d48c0e00c0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cannings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04e2832a-b2a8-3c39-8046-07d2783e5982",
                        "entry_id": "75cee9cc-7cec-3855-9ee0-c0d48c0e00c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The process of preserving food by heat processing in a sealed vessel (a jar or can)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7596c1e3-2235-4a03-a559-19aed573224c",
                                "sense_id": "04e2832a-b2a8-3c39-8046-07d2783e5982",
                                "text": "Although aluminium can replace tin in most dry cannings, it is not satisfactory for the canning of acid fruits […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec9f47b3-7a3b-3540-a853-b113530f9b05",
                        "entry_id": "75cee9cc-7cec-3855-9ee0-c0d48c0e00c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The practice of collecting aluminum cans or other recyclable objects; making money by collecting and selling such things."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c64753b3-6744-4bfb-95fb-fd79ae951fc1",
                                "sense_id": "ec9f47b3-7a3b-3540-a853-b113530f9b05",
                                "text": "Canners know when they hear the clink of a bottle going into a garbage bin.[…]\nCORNISH: Now, there's also this sense of loss in hearing people in the movie describe what they had been doing before canning became a way of life for them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52d078fe-dbbc-41b1-a434-8051be375fe3",
                                "sense_id": "ec9f47b3-7a3b-3540-a853-b113530f9b05",
                                "text": "“In canning, you go where you want and do what you want,” Gadsden says. “You’re your own boss.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6177acf-4e27-4180-9164-2458fef7203f",
                                "sense_id": "ec9f47b3-7a3b-3540-a853-b113530f9b05",
                                "text": "But the income that many Californians rely on from canning is imperiled by a crisis for recycling centers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
